# Endpoints

`pnpm endpoints:generate` refreshes `src/endpoints/*` from OpenAPI (`scripts/endpoints.codegen.json`). Generated files are AUTO-GENERATED — don't edit (keep `Types.ts`). No Zod in codegen.

- Shape: `*Body` request; `*Call` `{ request: { path?, params?, body? } }`; unwrap with `unwrapApiResult`.
- Calls via `api` (`@/utils/axios-instance`) only — not from UI components directly.
- Uploads: `toApiBody` · queries: `toSearchParams`.
- Errors: `getApiErrorMessage` / `extractApiFieldErrors` / field helpers (`@/utils/api-error`).
- Query keys: always `get<EndpointName>QueryKey(...)` from generated modules — never ad-hoc `["resource"]` strings.
- Params: use exported `*DefaultParams`; don't hardcode page sizes in UI.
- Enums: reuse `src/endpoints/enums.ts` types + `AS_CONST` arrays for selects/Zod.
